cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below."
title: "leakaudit: run 5 results (pre-registered)"
abstract: "Results of leakaudit's pre-registered fine-tuning run 5, scored on 2026-10-30 against the sealed key of real
  test 5 (68 public tables). Fine-tuning raised a 9B model's macro recall, at no more than one false flag per table,
  from 0.60 to 0.83; the vendor-style column check reached 0.36 and two frontier models 0.91 and 0.94. Three of five
  pre-registered hypotheses held (gain over the untrained model, gain over the column check, no loss on held-out
  generated domains); the gap to the best frontier model and the loss on disguised copies exceeded their 0.05 limits.
  RESULTS_run5.md summarizes them; results_run5.txt and results_run5.json are the scoring script's output. Test 5, the
  answers and the hand labels follow in release v1.0. Pre-registration: 10.5281/zenodo.23685637; answer fingerprints:
  10.5281/zenodo.23725257."
type: software
authors:
